		"description": "Posting restrictions settings pages (REQ-LBR-004) and the account guidance on the lines of JournalDetail and GeneralLedgerDetail (REQ-LBR-003). mergePages() replaces a page wholesale by id, so both detail pages are full copies of src/manifest.json with the fields moved into a data widget and the lines into a custom widget: re-sync if the base pages change."
	},
